<title>SINGAPORE: GRP Ltd six-months profit down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>GRP Ltd six-months profit down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to 31 Dec 96</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			0.51	vs   1.46</p>
<p>    Dividend			  2.50	vs   2.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	     0.61	vs   1.75</p>
<p>    Group share (fully diluted) 0.62	vs   1.74</p>
<p>    Turnover			 13.15	vs  14.83</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest 0.32	vs   0.59</p>
<p>    Interest			  0.22	vs   0.13</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	0.37	vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  1.34	 vs  2.45</p>
<p>    Tax				 0.41	 vs  0.69</p>
<p>    Minorities			0.17	 vs  0.24</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: April 25, 1997</p>
<p>Book Closure: April 8, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name is GRP Ltd. Its principal activities are trading in industrial rubber hoses, manufacturing and designing of hose fittings, provision of marine goods and marine safety services.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
